        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>顺时而变</title>\n<script>\n  window.MathJax = {\n    tex: {\n      inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n      displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n    }\n  };\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html,\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    min-height: 100%;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #d8d6cf;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 728px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    color: #34322f;\n    background:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(\n        to bottom,\n        transparent 0,\n        transparent 29px,\n        rgba(116, 116, 110, 0.42) 29px,\n        rgba(116, 116, 110, 0.42) 30px\n      ),\n      linear-gradient(\n        90deg,\n        #e9e7df 0%,\n        #f2f0e9 17%,\n        #efede6 52%,\n        #e7e5dd 100%\n      );\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 28px rgba(80, 76, 66, 0.13);\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"Kaiti SC\", \"DFKai-SB\", serif;\n  }\n\n  .header {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 48px;\n    right: 31px;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 17px;\n    align-items: center;\n    color: rgba(82, 78, 75, 0.55);\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .opening-stroke {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 42px;\n    left: 41px;\n    width: 21px;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: rgba(50, 48, 44, 0.72);\n    transform: rotate(5deg);\n  }\n\n  .writing {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 51px;\n    left: 41px;\n    width: 472px;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    line-height: 30px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: 0.35px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    text-shadow: 0.25px 0.2px 0 rgba(20, 20, 18, 0.35);\n    transform: rotate(0.1deg);\n    transform-origin: top left;\n  }\n\n  .line {\n    height: 30px;\n  }\n\n  .indent {\n    padding-left: 49px;\n  }\n\n  .footer-code {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 80px;\n    bottom: 19px;\n    color: rgba(82, 78, 74, 0.52);\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", serif;\n    font-size: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .footer-page {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 78px;\n    bottom: 40px;\n    width: 76px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    color: rgba(82, 78, 74, 0.52);\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", serif;\n    font-size: 8px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"opening-stroke\"></div>\n\n  <header class=\"header\">\n    <span>年</span>\n    <span>月</span>\n    <span>日（星期&nbsp;&nbsp;）</span>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"writing\">\n    <div class=\"line\">一吹就倒。这样多边摇摆，毫无立场，让己蒙羞，也</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">令人鄙夷。</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent\">顺时而变，就是根据环境需要适度改变自身形</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">态。这个世界唯一的不变，就是变化。古人云：“穷则</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">变，变则通，通则久。”为了灵活适应环境，我们应该</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">像茶叶一般，积极改变自身形态。处于茶盒里的，</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">茶叶干燥硬脆，便于长期保存；处于沸水中时，茶叶</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">柔顺自然，便于冲泡翻滚。秦朝末年的博士叔孙通</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">顺应大势，与时变化，最终成为西汉大儒；三国时期的</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">谋臣司马懿，与时舒卷，乘时而变，最终成为朝廷砥</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">柱。顺时而变，才能顺水行船，借风吹火，进而突飞</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">猛进，一发而不可收。</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent\">“位我上者，灿烂星空；道德律令，在我心中。”</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">这是康德心中的坚守。“天才时时求变，他们是自创法</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">则的人。”这是康德的顺时而变。我们应该像康德一</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">样，既能坚守心中认可的原则，也能打破某些束缚，顺时</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">而变。如此，我们的人生必将多姿多彩，辽阔高远。</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent\">古人言：“先圣法度，所宜坚守。”古人亦言：“以</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">不息为体，以日新为道。”让我们既能坚守本心，也能</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">顺时而变，在人生之路上不断前行，一步步行稳致</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">远吧！</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"footer-code\">14-650437</div>\n  <div class=\"footer-page\"><span>第</span><span>页</span></div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
